Evidence Description:
Provide the document that includes the minimum required password configuration rules for all in-scope systems. This may be included in the Logical Access Policy. Ensure that the password configurations for all systems adhere to this policy.
 For ISO, ensure that the Password Policy requires:
 -restricting sharing of passwords
 -compromised passwords process
 -use of strong passwords
 -the use of individual user IDs and passwords to maintain accountability;
 -allow users to select and change their own passwords and include a confirmation procedure to allow for input errors;
 -users to change their passwords at the first log-on;
 -regular password changes and as needed;
 -maintain a record of previously used passwords and prevent re-use;
 -not display passwords on the screen when being entered;
 -store and transmit passwords in a protected form.
